{
 "about": "The fixed list of measures per lens (DRAFT, for a planner to approve). Drawn from the pilot's 410 keys and the Planner Research Taxonomy's standing questions. key = <lens prefix>.<measure>. cardinality: one = a single value per period (and per qualifier) whose rivals contest; many = a list whose items sit side by side and never contest. qualifier: what distinguishes one row of the measure from another (none, player, channel, segment, moment, statement, rule, body, parent, metric, campaign). group: which targeted search finds it (1-3 per lens). synonyms: names the extraction model or an older list used for the measure, rewritten to it before a fact is written; a synonym given as {name, qualifier} also fixes the qualifier (tv_share_of_spend is media.channel_share for 'tv'). The middleware's own list (server/napkin/measures.json) was folded in as synonyms on 2026-10-04; this is now the only list.",
